      "artist": "Dsdugan",
      "credit": "Own work",
      "source": "24-01-188-plaque",
      "description": "Dedicated to the American Defenders of Bataan and Corregidor, Inc.\n\n\n\nThis plaque is dedicated as a tribute to those heroic defenders  who fought against overwhelming odds to defend the Philippine Islands against the Japanese Imperial Forces at the start of World War II.\n\n\nAlthough engaging in a long and valiant fight, ultimately they had to surrender. Their effort provided added time for the United States to mobilize their strength for final victory in World War II. Most of the defenders were made\nprisoners of war for the duration. Never has so much been done by so few to preserve  our freedom.\n\n\nD'Donnell War Personal Enclosure 1942\n\n\nIn memory of the American dead\nOmnia Pro Patria",
      "dateCreated": "2025-06-19 15:51:04",
